{"name": "Venomous Attacks", "type": "feat", "system": {"description": {"value": "<p>Creatures hit by your Eidolon's natural weapon attacks have to make a CON Saving Throw against your spell save DC. On failure, the target creature is Poisoned. A poisoned creature takes poison damage equal to twice your Proficiency at the start of each of its turns.</p><p>At the end of each of its turns, the creature can repeat the Saving Throw, ending the condition on a success.</p>", "chat": "", "unidentified": ""}, "source": "", "activation": {"type": "special", "cost": null, "condition": "creatures hit by your Eidolon's natural weapon attacks"}, "duration": {"value": "", "units": ""}, "cover": null, "crewed": false, "target": {"value": null, "width": null, "units": "", "type": ""}, "range": {"value": null, "long": null, "units": ""}, "uses": {"value": null, "max": "", "per": null, "recovery": ""}, "consume": {"type": "", "target": null, "amount": null}, "ability": null, "actionType": "save", "attackBonus": "", "chatFlavor": "", "critical": {"threshold": null, "damage": ""}, "damage": {"parts": [["2 * @prof", "poison"]], "versatile": ""}, "formula": "", "save": {"ability": "con", "dc": null, "scaling": "spell"}, "type": {"value": "", "subtype": ""}, "requirements": "", "recharge": {"value": null, "charged": null}}, "img": "icons/creatures/abilities/stinger-poison-green.webp", "_id": "se37b4c05e87d1b4", "_stats": {"systemId": "dnd5e", "systemVersion": "2.4.9", "coreVersion": "10.303", "createdTime": 1777072572464, "modifiedTime": 1777076181837, "lastModifiedBy": "dnd5ebuilder0000"}, "_key": "!items!se37b4c05e87d1b4"}